WEBVTT

00:04.750 --> 00:06.580
He's so sweet!

00:06.830 --> 00:08.290
Cute!

00:08.500 --> 00:10.130
He's showing us his belly!

00:12.130 --> 00:16.290
Whoa, this feels so nice...

00:18.330 --> 00:20.500
I love all these warm hands on me...

00:22.290 --> 00:24.670
Wait, hold up!

00:24.830 --> 00:27.170
You'll just let anybody do that to you?

00:28.250 --> 00:31.670
I thought we had something special.

00:32.290 --> 00:34.630
Shit, shit, shit!

00:37.080 --> 00:41.040
Hold on, though, whose dog is this?

00:41.630 --> 00:43.710
If he's a stray, I'm gonna take him h-

00:43.710 --> 00:44.710
Pochita!

00:51.960 --> 00:53.170
Beg for mommy!

00:57.130 --> 00:58.540
Inukai-san?!

00:58.540 --> 01:00.540
There are normal people here!

01:03.170 --> 01:04.790
B-beg.

01:05.830 --> 01:07.330
Beg for mommy.

01:07.830 --> 01:09.250
Beg for mommy!

01:09.920 --> 01:11.130
Beg for mommy.

01:11.670 --> 01:12.580
Beg for mommy!

01:12.580 --> 01:13.380
Oh, God, if I don't start begging,
she's gonna keep saying it!

01:13.380 --> 01:15.710
Beg for mommy. Beg for mommy!
Oh, God, if I don't start begging,<b>
</b>she's gonna keep saying it!<b></b>

01:15.710 --> 01:17.210
Do it for mommy!
Oh, God, if I don't start begging,<b>
</b>she's gonna keep saying it!<b></b>

01:19.380 --> 01:22.330
Keep your eyes on me! You're my sweet good boy!

01:22.330 --> 01:25.500
When I'm with you life is w-w-wonderful!

01:25.500 --> 01:28.580
1, 2, 3, now jump! Affectionate attention

01:28.580 --> 01:31.670
3, 2, 1, now turn! So many hot sparks

01:31.670 --> 01:34.830
1-to-1, now love! Unfortunate fraction

01:34.830 --> 01:37.920
From wonderful morning till night,
I'll give you everything

01:37.920 --> 01:41.000
Tell me how much you love me, my little boy

01:41.000 --> 01:44.630
Love me! Love me! Let me love you, I want you

01:45.170 --> 01:50.960
Live your life!
Sprint forward with all you've got!

01:50.960 --> 01:57.630
At the finish line is a new you
(Go beyond yourself!)

01:57.630 --> 02:03.420
Howl loud and proud!
Yesterday might have beaten you down

02:03.420 --> 02:06.460
But tomorrow (Affectionate Attention)
you and I (Unfortunate Fraction)

02:06.460 --> 02:10.670
Will shine as bright as we can!

02:10.670 --> 02:12.170
This is your life, your way!

02:12.290 --> 02:13.830
This is my life, my way!

02:13.960 --> 02:14.830
Woof!

02:18.170 --> 02:19.330
Beg for mommy.

02:18.790 --> 02:24.290
<b>Doggy Panic.</b>

02:19.330 --> 02:21.210
Beg for mommy! Do it for mommy!

02:21.210 --> 02:25.500
I'm gonna die of embarrassment
if I have to beg in front of everyone...

02:26.880 --> 02:28.170
But...

02:28.170 --> 02:31.210
The last thing I want is for Inukai-san
to die of embarrassment!

02:34.420 --> 02:35.500
Beg for mommy!

02:36.460 --> 02:37.960
Beg for mommy! Beg for-

02:40.580 --> 02:43.380
N-now they're all calling me a good boy?!

02:43.710 --> 02:45.500
What the hell is happening here?!

02:51.710 --> 02:53.960
It's hard to balance on two legs...

02:55.580 --> 02:57.790
And now that they're up on two legs,
I can see their undies!

03:00.420 --> 03:03.580
Aww, he's okay. Look how he's panting.

03:03.960 --> 03:06.380
And those cute little eyes!

03:09.080 --> 03:13.000
So wait, this is your dog, Inukai-san?

03:13.790 --> 03:19.130
Now you definitely have to bring him
to the dog café. Is that cool?

03:19.790 --> 03:20.790
Huh?

03:24.130 --> 03:26.040
But he's my dog, I don't want-

03:26.040 --> 03:28.130
He's such a good boy,

03:28.830 --> 03:30.790
and he's such a cutie.

03:31.290 --> 03:34.380
Yeah... Pochita's a real cutie...

03:34.380 --> 03:35.710
Yay!

03:35.710 --> 03:38.000
No way our café will fail
with this puppy here!

03:38.000 --> 03:38.830
Huh?

03:38.830 --> 03:40.460
You're totally right!

03:40.460 --> 03:43.710
You'll help us with
the dog café, right, Inukai-san?

03:43.710 --> 03:44.710
Huh?

03:45.000 --> 03:47.880
You can wear a maid outfit
with the rest of us!

03:47.880 --> 03:48.710
Huh?

03:48.710 --> 03:52.540
And guys would line up down the hall
to have you serve them food and drink!

03:52.540 --> 03:54.330
You're gonna look so cute!

03:54.670 --> 03:57.170
You know, they're absolutely right!

04:11.000 --> 04:16.210
<b>Sakihiro Gakuen</b>

04:11.920 --> 04:15.330
With that, everyone started prepping
for the school festival.

04:29.420 --> 04:31.670
Our classroom's full of dogs...

04:33.000 --> 04:35.830
But Pochita's definitely the cutest.

04:37.290 --> 04:39.080
So, not complaining,

04:39.080 --> 04:41.920
but why are the dogs here
when we're not even done decorating?

04:41.920 --> 04:44.710
We want to the dogs to get
acclimated to the classroom.

04:46.130 --> 04:48.500
Okay, guys, listen up!

04:48.750 --> 04:52.460
Today, we're all gonna focus on
making paper chains!

04:52.460 --> 04:54.040
Okay.

04:57.960 --> 05:00.460
I get to be here during the setup, too!

04:59.250 --> 05:04.330
<b>Welcome to our Dog Café!</b>

05:01.000 --> 05:02.830
There's no better chance than now!

05:03.210 --> 05:04.330
Before that...

05:05.710 --> 05:08.710
I should figure out where
that tracker is on me...

05:10.250 --> 05:14.500
And I can't leave unless I get
this collar off me.

05:16.710 --> 05:18.170
Inukai-san...

05:18.670 --> 05:20.920
Guess she's not the crafty type.

05:23.210 --> 05:24.630
What a cute pouty face.

05:27.790 --> 05:30.790
But why's she working all the way over here?

05:31.130 --> 05:33.290
Guess she just likes being alone.

05:34.080 --> 05:36.000
Yo, Karen!

05:37.540 --> 05:40.630
You guys are doing a dog café?

05:40.880 --> 05:44.420
The judo team's doing a hot dog stand,

05:44.420 --> 05:47.040
so I grilled up a few to practice.

05:47.040 --> 05:50.330
I thought Nekotani smelled good!
That's why!

05:50.580 --> 05:52.710
Working all by yourself over here?

05:53.130 --> 05:56.000
I'm not all by myself.
Pochita's here, too.

05:56.380 --> 05:57.210
Huh?!

05:59.250 --> 06:01.460
Welp, guess she's still scared of dogs.

06:01.460 --> 06:04.420
Wh-what the hell is Pochita-kun doing here?!

06:13.880 --> 06:17.580
Ugh, I got glue all over my clothes...

06:19.500 --> 06:20.790
Are you okay?

06:20.790 --> 06:23.380
Yeah, just sticky. Ah, geez...

06:23.380 --> 06:24.670
Wait here.

06:24.670 --> 06:27.080
I'll get something that can help get it off.

06:27.080 --> 06:29.170
Huh?! Hold on, Karen!

06:29.500 --> 06:31.420
Stay there with Pochita.

06:31.420 --> 06:33.750
I wasn't worried about him!

06:34.000 --> 06:36.080
C'mon, Karen!

06:40.960 --> 06:43.460
Yeah, that looks totally innocent...

06:48.250 --> 06:49.920
Why are they freaking out all of a sudden?

06:49.920 --> 06:52.290
What's wrong with the dogs?
Why are they freaking out all of a sudden?<b></b>

06:55.040 --> 06:56.420
Wait...

06:56.420 --> 06:58.920
Is it because Nekotani smells like hot dogs?!

06:59.790 --> 07:00.960
Why are there so many?!

07:01.670 --> 07:02.580
Huh?!

07:08.210 --> 07:11.670
Oh, God! Pochita's stuck to my skirt!

07:12.210 --> 07:15.580
Dammit, my paws are stuck
and they won't come off!

07:17.250 --> 07:19.040
Hey! Where are you going?!

07:23.460 --> 07:26.830
Wait, she's just gonna
take the whole thing off?!

07:32.080 --> 07:32.880
Ow!

07:32.880 --> 07:35.460
Ow, that hurts! Ouch!

07:35.920 --> 07:39.250
Wait, crap! Nekotani, your undies
are on full display right now!

07:41.670 --> 07:45.130
If you don't calm down, you're gonna end up
giving the whole school a free show!

07:45.790 --> 07:47.790
Pochita-kun?! What are you-

07:52.170 --> 07:53.500
Ow, ow...

07:55.040 --> 07:56.130
Nekotani?!

07:59.460 --> 08:01.500
Just when I thought
it couldn't get any worse!

08:01.500 --> 08:04.290
Whatever, I gotta get unstuck, and fast!

08:25.170 --> 08:28.170
C'mon... Dammit!

08:32.710 --> 08:34.500
Almost there...

08:34.670 --> 08:36.080
Almost got it...

08:36.420 --> 08:37.380
There!

08:48.460 --> 08:50.670
Wha- what the hell?!

08:50.670 --> 08:52.420
Where are my clothes?!

08:52.750 --> 08:55.290
Was I seriously running around
like this?! No!

08:55.540 --> 08:56.790
Huh? What?!

08:57.420 --> 09:00.080
Oh no, someone's coming!
What now?!

09:03.420 --> 09:06.000
You want me to go that way? O-okay!

09:11.790 --> 09:13.750
I should be fine here...

09:13.750 --> 09:14.630
Oh, no!

09:26.540 --> 09:29.500
Did you save me from a tough spot again?

09:29.790 --> 09:32.630
You sure are a smart cookie.

09:33.130 --> 09:37.000
You're just like the old Pochita.

09:38.330 --> 09:40.250
The old Pochita?

09:42.790 --> 09:44.750
Here, this was Pochita.

09:45.130 --> 09:48.960
I've known Karen since we were little,

09:48.960 --> 09:52.170
and back then,
she had this really cute dog.

09:55.750 --> 09:59.000
Inukai-san... She's smiling.

09:59.880 --> 10:03.330
The three of us loved to play together.

10:03.880 --> 10:08.750
Though I'm pretty sure he's the reason
I'm scared of dogs now...

10:09.670 --> 10:12.630
Sadly, he died a couple of years back,

10:12.630 --> 10:15.710
and I haven't seen Karen smile ever since.

10:17.290 --> 10:22.670
But now that you're here,
Karen's shown so much more emotion.

10:23.000 --> 10:25.630
She's smiling, she's getting jealous...

10:26.040 --> 10:28.790
All the things I could never get her to feel.

10:34.830 --> 10:36.330
Did she just...

10:39.330 --> 10:42.830
Ugh, did I really just have
a whole conversation with a dog?

10:43.630 --> 10:47.040
I dunno, maybe it's 'cause
you don't really feel like a dog.

10:47.040 --> 10:48.000
Huh?

10:48.000 --> 10:50.380
You're like, too smart.

10:50.380 --> 10:51.540
Wait...

10:52.000 --> 10:54.210
Maybe you're not actually a dog...

10:55.330 --> 10:56.880
But a real person?

10:58.290 --> 10:59.670
She knows?!

11:02.500 --> 11:06.250
Come home! Come home! Come home! Come home!

11:07.290 --> 11:09.880
Come home! Come home! Come home! Come home!

11:09.880 --> 11:12.130
Let's Go! Come Home, Boy!

11:12.290 --> 11:16.710
You're so cute, I can't help but love you!

11:16.710 --> 11:21.880
I'll take you home and make you happy,
so c'mere, boy!

11:21.880 --> 11:26.000
The secret moments when I pet and kiss you

11:26.380 --> 11:31.040
Are precious moments to be honest about my love

11:31.420 --> 11:33.580
This feeling I'm yearning for

11:33.960 --> 11:35.960
This feeling I've been hiding

11:36.500 --> 11:38.330
This feeling I've finally found

11:38.330 --> 11:40.000
Hear it now! Feel it now!

11:40.000 --> 11:42.000
I l-l-l-l-love you!

11:42.000 --> 11:45.710
I hope my feelings will reach you one day

11:45.880 --> 11:50.080
One day, when you look up and see me

11:50.080 --> 11:52.630
I wanna be number one in your puppy heart!

11:52.630 --> 11:55.500
From the bottom of my heart, I love you!
